        "date": "2026-11-24T21:25:30Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): a Recipes tab for a tool's cutting data per material\n\nThe tool library window's editor gets a Recipes tab. It draws the tool's\ncutting rows with read-only surface speed (Vc) and feed per tooth (fz)\ncolumns, and it marks the row that the document's material runs.\n\"Suggest\" fills a row from the cutting table and \"Copy from tool\" takes\nanother tool's material rows. Both write only the window's draft; the\neditor's one Apply lands it as one ChangeTool undo step.\n\nStacked on #3931.\n\nFixes #3896\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
