        "name": "Quintin Smits",
        "email": "qd.smits@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-24T21:51:20Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): judge the Apply holder refusal on the stored tool\n\nThe assembly group named the Apply holder refusal from the unapplied\ntool draft, but SetToolBody::library checks the stored tool. Unapplied\nflute edits could hide a real refusal or show a false one. The preview\nmodel now takes the refusal from the stored tool (the key's document\ntool) and keeps the draft numbers' verdict as a separate draft note.\n\nPinned by the_refusal_judges_the_stored_tool_not_shorter_draft_flutes\nand longer_draft_flutes_give_a_draft_note_not_an_apply_refusal.\n\nRefs #3895\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
